    "text": "flagscanner.com\nwebsite\nFlagstaff\nUPDATE TO WILDLAND FIRE WEST OF FLAGSTAFF : #Soggybottomfire\n1 days ago\n2:46 PM USFS has units responding to a new wildland fire start in the area of Forest Service Rd 518 and southwest of A-1 Mountain. The fire is small at this time, but smoke can be seen from Woody Mountain Fire Lookout Tower. No structures are believed to be threatened at this time. Updates will be below.\n1",
